"hol.conf.hint":"Tip: if you follow another religion, you may choose the Jewish holidays instead of your own confession’s national holidays. Your paid days off then match the countrywide calendar (kindergartens, banks, government offices), and your religious dates can be taken from your vacation days or unpaid.",
