 "vat.note":"Fill either field — the other is calculated automatically. VAT since 01.01.2025 — <b>18%</b>. Osek patur does not charge VAT.",
 "vat.line.vat":"VAT 18%","vat.line.total":"Total incl. VAT","vat.line.net":"Amount before VAT","vat.line.incl":"incl. VAT 18%",
